A results directory calling itself `reproducible-by-config` whose record is
adapted from a source that is `pinned_only`. The digest pins WHICH log was
read; it does not make that log reachable, and an unscrubbed session
transcript cannot enter this repository. Nothing can re-fire it, so the
honest kind is `historical-observation`.

Its weights are a digest and not hosted, on purpose: a fixture red for
another fixture's reason is not a pass, and the hosted refusal already has
its own case next door.
